From 930a82c8624e7876ea8d55ba49786c21aedfb324 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Tue, 06 Oct 2026 08:19:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Pen: Cap refresh rate only while the pen is in use

Cap the refresh rate while the pen reports itself active and ack its
status once the panel runs at a supported rate. Fall back to capping
on connection only until a GATT session is up; the pen notifies status
changes only, so treat it as idle until it reports otherwise.

Pens without the BLE pressure service still get a status-only session
that leaves the touch HAL alone.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Iac1fab92543e68f5559213bd125edcab23b78420
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

